{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:746c1069faeb1db9","name":"A-Wing Starfighter","source":{"id":"source:reference-746c1069faeb1db9","title":"A-Wing Starfighter","revision":15596,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:52:51Z","sha256":"676f4c7bc4ad752e404399347784409eae755b413cdb8145e676d5c2cae7f3f9","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=15596","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=A-Wing%20Starfighter&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-746c1069faeb1db9","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Republic","referenceId":"reference:e6046dbb57e5abb0"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Zann Consortium"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Zann_Consortium","referenceId":"reference:939c32df8a6e4fbd"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Development of the A-Wing began in secret shortly after the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yavin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yavin"},". General ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jan Dodonna"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jan_Dodonna","referenceId":"reference:6128f2dc6d8f43b1"}," realized that the speed of Imperial fighters had nearly cost the Alliance its victory, and he intended to remedy the situation by designing a newer, faster ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},". With the aid of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," engineer ",{"tag":"a","children":["Walex Blissex"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Walex_Blissex?action=edit&redlink=1"},", the A-Wing was born. Although not as durable as other Alliance ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"},", the A-Wing is often considered to be the fastest ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," to see service during the Galactic Civil War.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Though the A-Wing is a finicky spacecraft that is often difficult to maintain in the field, it has proven itself to be a capable strike fighter and reconnaissance craft. Due to its speed and maneuverability, it excels at \"hit and fade\" operations and surgical strikes carried out behind enemy lines. Despite its relatively light armament, the A-Wing is deadly in the hands of a skilled pilot. During the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Endor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endor"},", A-Wings were responsible for the destruction of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Super Star Destroyer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Super_Star_Destroyer"}," ",{"tag":"i","children":["Executor"]},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Capabilities"]},{"tag":"p","children":["\nA-Wings are phenomenally fast and agile spacecraft, making them capable dogfighters. A-Wing pilots quickly learn to use this fact to their advantage in battle, for even a single hit from an enemy weapon can mean a quick and fiery death. During its earliest months in service, the A-Wing was armed only with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Laser Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Laser_Cannons"}," and a sophisticated suite of electronic jammers. In time, many A-Wings were modified to carry ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concussion Missile Launchers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concussion_Missile_Launchers"},", adding to the nimble ship's versatility (this configuration was standard by the time of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Republic","referenceId":"reference:e6046dbb57e5abb0"},")."]},{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["A-Wing Starfighter Statistics (CL 9)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Huge ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +12; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 19 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 11), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 23; +3 Armor, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 80; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},": 10; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},": 15; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},": 33\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Offense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," Fly 16 Squares (",{"tag":"a","children":["Character Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Character_Scale"},"), 